{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Bb]The hour has come for the [Eb]Son of Man
[Bb]to be glorified in this [Fsus4]place [F]
[Gm]Truly, tru[F]ly, I [Eb]tell you [Bb]now
[Eb]what the [Bb]grain of wheat will [Fsus4]face [F]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-Chorus}
[Eb]Unless it falls into the [Gm]earth
and dies within the [Eb]dark
it remains alone, a [Gm]single seed
with no life to [Fsus4][F]mark
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
But if it [Bb]dies, it [F/A]bears much [Gm]fruit
the [Gm7/F]hidden [Eb]life [Bb]breaks [F]through
Whoever [Bb]loves his life [F/A]loses [Gm]it
while [F]hate keeps it for [Eb]you
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Bb]Whoever hates his life in this [Eb]world
[Bb]will keep it for eternal [F]life
[Gm]If anyone [F]serves me, [Eb]follow [Bb]close
[Eb]where I am, he will strive
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-Chorus}
[F]Where [Eb]I am, there my ser[Gm]vant will be
honored by the Father’s hand
No [Eb]servant stands alone in this
[Gm]the Father’s love commands
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
But if it dies, it [F]bears much fruit
the hid[Bb]den life [F/A]breaks through
[Gm]Whoev[Gm7/F]er loves [Eb]his [Bb]life los[F]es it
while hate [Bb]keeps it for [F/A]you
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
Now [Gm]my soul [F]is troubled deep[Eb]ly
what shall I say [Cm]to the sky
Fa[Gm]ther, save me from [F]this hour
[Cm]is the prayer that rises high
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
[Gm]No, for [F]this [Cm]purpose I came
[Gm]to stand in this [F]hour
The grain falls, [Eb]the fruit [F]rises
[Bb]the glory is ours
{end_of_verse}

